type="journal">Xie, J., and D.P. McCobb. <year>1998</year>. Control of alternative splicing of potassium channels by stress hormones. <source>Science.</source> <volume>280</volume>:<fpage>443</fpage>&#x02013;446.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9545224</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><citation citation-type="journal">Zhang, X., C.R. Solaro, and C.J. Lingle. <year>2001</year>. Allosteric regulation of BK channel gating by Ca<sup>2&#x0002b;</sup> and Mg<sup>2&#x0002b;</sup> through a nonselective, low affinity divalent cation site. <source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source> <volume>118</volume>:<fpage>607</fpage>&#x02013;636.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11696615</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>